  "statement": "Trustworthiness is critical in a bookkeeping system to protect sensitive financial data and ensure user privacy. My requirements (TRU-01 to TRU-07) focus on encryption, access control, and maintaining an immutable audit trail, which are essential for preventing unauthorized access and ensuring data integrity. Without these measures, the system could be vulnerable to fraud and data breaches, undermining user trust and compliance with financial regulations. However, I recognize potential conflicts with efficiency and sustainability requirements that may impact processing speed and energy consumption.",
